{"4711710": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Rolling Splat!", "steam_appid": 4711710, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [5051930], "detailed_description": "<h1>Rollin' Community (Discord)</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4711710/extras/491f492819a3a37f32b857b0e47fe121.avif?t=1788107861\" width=780 height=200 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>This game will test your sanity, your swinging skills, and your friendships.</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can either: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play Solo: like some insane person who loves to suffer </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play Online CO-OP: and split the suffering among your friends group (more healthy)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4711710/extras/3604729a7db1d921f8400c05aa4ab51d.poster.avif?t=1788107861\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4711710/extras/3604729a7db1d921f8400c05aa4ab51d.webm?t=1788107861\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4711710/extras/3604729a7db1d921f8400c05aa4ab51d.mp4?t=1788107861\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A cute, chaotic, and physics-based adventure game!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a round, squishy frog (or other quirky creatures).  <br>Join forces with your friends to embark on a heartwarming yet thrilling journey through a massive, bizarre world. Starting from the very bottom of the universe, you are determined to climb to the peak. Roll, jump, and swing your way through creative contraptions and vastly different fantasy realms to reach the ultimate end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4711710/extras/6ee67e6c72c4f4d217d5c01f26a5bad1.poster.avif?t=1788107861\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4711710/extras/6ee67e6c72c4f4d217d5c01f26a5bad1.webm?t=1788107861\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4711710/extras/6ee67e6c72c4f4d217d5c01f26a5bad1.mp4?t=1788107861\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple Yet Satisfying Physics:</strong> Master the art of rolling, jumping, and swinging. It’s easy to pick up, but offers plenty of room for skill and high-flying mastery!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Only Way is Up:</strong> Challenge yourself in a vertical ascent from the deepest depths, overcoming massive height differences and thrilling obstacles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ever-Changing Levels:</strong> Journey through various uniquely themed worlds packed with imaginative mechanics. Every stage brings a fresh, surprising experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hilarious, Out-of-Control Physics:</strong> Get launched, bumped, and rolled around! The chaotic physics guarantee endless laughs for you and your friends.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4711710/extras/d9853700823bf1b32c1585a0b74bbbb8.poster.avif?t=1788107861\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4711710/extras/d9853700823bf1b32c1585a0b74bbbb8.webm?t=1788107861\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4711710/extras/d9853700823bf1b32c1585a0b74bbbb8.mp4?t=1788107861\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Highlights</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Handcrafted Solo Campaign:</strong> Immerse yourself in a charming story with meticulously designed level challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Better with Friends:</strong> Full co-op support! Tackle the obstacles together and share the joy—and the hilarious frustration—with your buddies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Playtime:</strong> Roughly 3–5 hours for the main story adventure.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With its adorable art style, snappy physics, and laugh-out-loud chaotic moments, this is the perfect game for anyone who loves cozy yet challenging physics adventures!</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>This game will test your sanity, your swinging skills, and your friendships.</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can either: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play Solo: like some insane person who loves to suffer </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play Online CO-OP: and split the suffering among your friends group (more healthy)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4711710/extras/3604729a7db1d921f8400c05aa4ab51d.poster.avif?t=1788107861\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4711710/extras/3604729a7db1d921f8400c05aa4ab51d.webm?t=1788107861\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=v